# The sb-deps dependency graphs, both the postprocessed `dependency-previews.json`
# the addon reads and the `.raw.json` dependency-cruiser hands it. Generated from
# the source tree on every `sb`, `sb:build` and `sb:deps` run, so a checkout never
# needs a copy — and tracking them means a graph that silently goes stale whenever
# the source or the generator changes, which is exactly what happened before.
#
# The raw file is worse still: `summary.optionsUsed` records the absolute
# `baseDir` and `rulesFile` of whichever machine last ran the generator, so each
# person who regenerates commits their own paths over everyone else's.
**/.storybook/dependency-previews*.json

# graphify-axet
.graphify/
